  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 11 in each of the two bands (the table is printed as two stacked bands, each running across the spread with the 年次 column repeated at the right edge of the right page). 同 expanded in year labels. Amount columns are in 圓 (小さい 円 above first row); person columns are counts.",
   "Row '大正 12', 開墾 — 人員 — 總數: second digit overstruck/smudged (reads '2?' ; neighbouring 邦人 is 23); left as [?].",
   "Check 總數 = 邦人 + 島民 for every 人員 triple: reconciles in all cells (開墾 大正 12 not checkable).",
   "Check 金額 triples: reconcile except 1-yen differences in 總數 vs 邦人+島民 (printed 總數 one yen higher) at 大正 11, 12, 13 (總數), 大正 11, 12, 13, 14, 昭和 2, 昭和 4 (新植), 昭和 6 (總數), consistent with 圓位未滿切捨; source not corrected.",
   "The 總數 group and 新植 group figures for 島民 金額 print identical values in 大正 11-13 as printed (5,101, 103, 2,632)."
